[!] Duplicate netlist detected. Retrying 1/3...
 Try a different approach. For 200V to 5V buck, consider:
- L1 on input side (200V to sw), M1 is low-side switch
- D1 across sw->0, Rload from out->0
- C1 from out->0, Rload=Vout^2/P
- Vgate is 12V pulse to drive M1
- Rbleed on sw node
- t_on for 100kHz: 5u for T=10u
